{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15156,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-watchos-26-6-tvos-26-6-visionos-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta di watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple mette a disposizione degli sviluppatori le prime beta di watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS 26.6. Nessuna novità confermata al momento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15128,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T11:30:27+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T06:35:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-nuove-funzioni-salute-watch-face-satelliti-rumor\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27: nuove funzioni tra salute, watch face e satelliti (rumor)\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su watchOS 27: miglioramenti al tracciamento della frequenza cardiaca, nuove watch face e possibili funzioni satellitari. Focus anche su stabilità e performance.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15100,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T16