gni-proprietario\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch: 15 consigli utili per ogni proprietario\",\"excerpt\":\"Scopri 15 tips pratici per sfruttare al meglio Apple Watch: app, notifiche, allenamenti, controlli e funzioni meno note.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-15-Tips-Every-Owner-Needs-to-Know-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-15-Tips-Every-Owner-Needs-to-Know-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14730,\"date\":\"2026-05-09T09:51:58+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-09T07:51:58+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-series-12-watchos-27-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Series 12 e watchOS 27: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su Touch ID, nuovi chip, nuove watch face e funzioni Apple Intelligence e satellite in watchOS 27, con lancio atteso a settembre.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-Touch-ID\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14661,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T15:35:25+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:35:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"pixel-non-adotteranno-liquid-glass-apple\",\"title\":\"Pixel non adotteranno il design “Liquid Glass” di Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Sameer Samat, presidente Android per Google, smentisce l’adozione del design “Liquid Glass” su Pixel. Restano